the same for the same system, and `prismDodecagonalAntiprism_nu_reps` the statement in Mathlib's terms alone (`IsPolyRootEq`):
`ν Antiprism.DodecagonalAntiprism.polyhedron` is the first coordinate of the root of each of these systems, each with exactly one root in its
