Generated by `lean/scripts/exact_n.py` from the theorems of `Nieuwland.Certs.NieuwlandPrismDodecagonalAntiprism`, `Nieuwland.Certs.NieuwlandPrismDodecagonalAntiprism.Exact` and
`Nieuwland.Certs.NieuwlandPrismDodecagonalAntiprism.Roots`, which it does not change.
