/-- **The Nieuwland number of `Antiprism.DodecagonalAntiprism.polyhedron`, by representatives**: `ν Antiprism.DodecagonalAntiprism.polyhedron` lies in `[k, k + 1] / 10 ^ 30`, and it is the first coordinate of the root of each of finitely many systems of integer polynomial equations, each in a rational box of all its variables and each with exactly one root in its box (`IsPolyRootEq`, `Modules/System/PolyRootEq.lean`); the systems are those of `prismDodecagonalAntiprism_nu_reps_list`. -/
theorem prismDodecagonalAntiprism_nu_reps :
    ν Antiprism.DodecagonalAntiprism.polyhedron ∈ Set.Icc ((1000343536738933446038733499185 : ℝ) / 10 ^ 30) ((1000343536738933446038733499186 : ℝ) / 10 ^ 30) ∧
      IsPolyRootEq (ν Antiprism.DodecagonalAntiprism.polyhedron) :=
  ⟨prismDodecagonalAntiprism_nu.1, PolynomialSystem.isPolyRootEq (by decide +kernel) prismDodecagonalAntiprism_nu_reps_list⟩

